{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2019-10-14 09:30:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA ENERGY SELLS CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA IN CHILE FOR $2.23 BLN', 'text': "PRESS RELEASE - SEMPRA ENERGY ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO SELL CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA IN CHILE.SEMPRA ENERGY - DEAL FOR $2.23 BILLION IN CASH.SEMPRA ENERGY - ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS EQUITY INTERESTS IN ITS CHILEAN BUSINESSES, INCLUDING ITS 100% STAKE IN CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA S.A..SEMPRA ENERGY - SEMPRA ENERGY'S INTERESTS WILL BE SOLD FOR $2.23 BILLION.SEMPRA ENERGY - DEAL WOULD COMPLETE SALE OF SEMPRA ENERGY'S EQUITY INTERESTS IN SOUTH AMERICAN BUSINESSES.SEMPRA ENERGY - CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA SIGNED AN AGREEMENT TO PURCHASE REMAINING 50% INTEREST IN ELETRANS S.A. FROM SOCIEDAD AUSTRAL DE ELECTRICIDAD S.A.SEMPRA ENERGY - TO SELL EQUITY INTERESTS IN ITS CHILEAN BUSINESSES TO STATE GRID INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT LIMITED.SEMPRA ENERGY - SALE ALSO WILL INCLUDE SEMPRA ENERGY'S 100% INTEREST IN TECNORED S.A.SEMPRA ENERGY - TRANSACTION PROCEEDS WILL BE USED TO STRENGTHEN CO'S BALANCE SHEET, SUPPORT GROWING CAPITAL NEEDS OF UTILITIES IN CALIFORNIA & TEXAS."}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2019-10-13 22:30:00', 'title': 'STATE GRID INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT CO., LTD. ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA S.A. AND TECNORED S.A. FROM SEMPRA ENERGY (NYSE:SRE) FOR $2.2 BILLION.', 'text': "STATE GRID INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT CO., LTD. ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA S.A. AND TECNORED S.A. FROM SEMPRA ENERGY (NYSE:SRE) FOR $2.2 BILLION ON OCTOBER 12, 2019. UNDER THE TERMS, SEMPRA ENERGY'S EQUITY INTERESTS IN ITS CHILEAN BUSINESSES WILL BE SOLD FOR $2.23 BILLION IN CASH, SUBJECT TO ADJUSTMENTS FOR WORKING CAPITAL AND NET INDEBTEDNESS AND OTHER ADJUSTMENTS. THE TRANSACTION INCLUDES THE SALE OF SEMPRA’S 100% INTEREST IN CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA S.A. AND 100% INTEREST IN TECNORED S.A. THE SALE WILL ALSO INCLUDE CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA’S 50% STAKE IN ELETRANS S.A. IN A RELATED TRANSACTION, CHILQUINTA ENERGÍA SIGNED AN AGREEMENT TO PURCHASE THE REMAINING 50% INTEREST IN ELETRANS S.A. FROM SOCIEDAD AUSTRAL DE ELECTRICIDAD S.A. ON OCTOBER 12, 2019. THIS TRANSACTION WILL ENABLE SEMPRA ENERGY TO\xa0TRANSFER\xa0100% OWNERSHIP OF ELETRANS S.A. TO SGID AND WILL BE CONTINGENT UPON THE CLOSING OF THE TRANSACTION BETWEEN STATE GRID INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT AND SEMPRA. THE SALE TO SGID IS SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY CLOSING CONDITIONS, INCLUDING APPROVAL BY THE CHILEAN ANTI-TRUST AUTHORITY, CERTAIN CHINESE REGULATORY APPROVALS AND APPROVAL BY THE BERMUDA MONETARY AUTHORITY AND IS EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED IN THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2020. PROCEEDS FROM THE TRANSACTION WILL BE USED TO ADVANCE SEMPRA’S BUSINESS STRATEGY BY STRENGTHENING ITS BALANCE SHEET AND SUPPORTING THE GROWING CAPITAL NEEDS OF ITS UTILITIES IN\xa0CALIFORNIA\xa0AND\xa0TEXAS. BOFA MERRILL LYNCH AND LAZARD ARE SERVING AS FINANCIAL ADVISORS TO SEMPRA ENERGY ON THE SALES, AND THOMAS LAURIA, MARWAN AZZI, GREG PRYOR, MICHAEL DEYONG, DAVID DREIER, HENRIK PATEL, ARLENE ARIN HAHN, DAMIEN NYER, SETH KERSCHNER, VIVIAN TSOI OF WHITE & CASE IS SERVING AS LEGAL ADVISOR. JUDIE NG SHORTELL, MARK BERGMAN, HANS-GUNTHER HERRMANN, KIT MAK, DAVID SICULA, CHRISTOPHER BOEHNING, CHRISTOPHER FREY, MARTA KELLY OF PAUL WEISS RIFKIND WHARTON & GARRISON ACTED AS A LEGAL ADVISOR TO STATE GRID INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT LIMITED. GOLDMAN SACHS LLC ACTED AS FINANCIAL ADVISOR TO STATE GRID INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT CO., LTD. SULLIVAN & CROMWELL LLP IS ADVISING MERRILL LYNCH, PIERCE, FENNER & SMITH INCORPORATED AS FINANCIAL ADVISOR TO SEMPRA ENERGY, IN CONNECTION WITH ITS $2.2 BILLION CASH ACQUISITION BY STATE GRID INTERNATIONAL DEVELOPMENT CO., LTD.\n"}